# =====================================================================
# WotaGeiCam monorepo
#   Android/    ← 上游安卓工程（Gradle）
#   HarmonyOS/  ← 鸿蒙复现工程（DevEco / hvigor）
# 各自目录内还有更细的 .gitignore；本文件管跨平台产物与仓库根状态。
# =====================================================================

# ===== 跨平台构建产物 =====
build/
*/build/
.gradle/
.kotlin/
.cxx/
.externalNativeBuild/
captures/
*.apk
*.aab
*.ap_
*.dex
*.class
*.hap
*.har
*.hsp

# ===== 仓库根 CI 暂存目录 =====
/apk-out/
/dist/

# ===== Android =====
/Android/local.properties
/Android/keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
!/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
# 内部材料沿用 main 的公开边界（monorepo 里路径多了一层 Android/）
/Android/AGENTS.md
/Android/readme.md
/Android/.zcodeignore
/Android/.github/
/Android/docs/
/Android/deliverable/
/Android/research/
/Android/tools/

# ===== HarmonyOS（HarmonyOS/.gitignore 为主，这里兜底）=====
/HarmonyOS/.hvigor/
/HarmonyOS/oh_modules/
/HarmonyOS/node_modules/
/HarmonyOS/.cxx/
/HarmonyOS/.pure-test-tmp/
/HarmonyOS/.local-signing/
/HarmonyOS/local.properties

# ===== IDE / 编辑器 =====
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.fleet/
.navigation/
.vscode/

# ===== 临时与缓存 =====
.tmp/
tmp/
*.log
*.bak
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ===== mapping 归档 =====
deliverable/**/mapping/

# ===== 本机工具链（体积大且可重装）=====
tools/android-sdk/
tools/**/platform-tools/
tools/**/build-tools/

# ===== 会话与工具本地状态 =====
.mimosa/
.zcode/
agent-memory/
node_modules/
package.json
package-lock.json

# ===== 交接文档（按 Handover_Android.md 的口径：留在磁盘，不入版本库）=====
/Handover_*.md
/Handover.md
